  "statuteText": "216-J:4 Gifts, Grants, or Donations. –\n\nThe commission is authorized to institute a program to solicit and receive any gifts, grants, or donations made for the implementation of the master development plan and to deposit such gifts, grants, or donations in the Hampton Beach master plan fund."
